{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"26fc2b838dee109d97491790ad1eae019af0b8197dd59ac10a3918b6104dffbe","ja":"かき氷屋さん、開店！","zh":"刨冰店，开张！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e1c1846812a1a7ccc9fdf3a2a0467c005e712839709dbac15af78b82e85d2fd9","ja":"星梨花と環は相談しながら準備を整え、\nかき氷屋さん出店の日を迎えた……","zh":"星梨花和环一边商量一边做好了准备，\n迎来了刨冰店出摊的日子……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"84b2cdcbda26a94a8d5a30e1762390c34c4750d7b172c44417783dc380133922","ja":"いらっしゃいませー！\n冷たくてあまーいかき氷、売ってるよー！","zh":"欢迎光临——！\n清凉又甜～美的刨冰，正在热卖中哦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"035c678c8bdad6e86a3caca14ad7b9e16ccb5424de86b754b42ba47493601dff","ja":"フルーツがのった、かわいいかき氷です！\n体を冷やすのにも、ピッタリですよー！","zh":"放了水果的可爱刨冰！\n也非常适合用来解暑哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f2ca0d8ffb4e9cb76aaa6ade316486444c01ef5e6edd438ee9a7d22fa912d307","ja":"「かき氷か。ちょっと食べていこうかな」\n「小さいのにお店なんてすごいね。それじゃあひとつ」","zh":"“是刨冰啊。吃一点再走吧”\n“年纪小小就能看店真了不起呢。那就给我来一份吧”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9c5d8bee6cf4bb4dcdb2ccd6e10eff18f6dc55c7854f2a394918c80e3baa0a64","ja":"くふふ♪　みんな買ってくれるね！\nこれなら、目標たっせいできそうだぞ！","zh":"呵呵呵♪ 大家都有来买呢！\n这样的话，感觉能达成目标哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"81aaf70bb2d777401b6baac5c4ca956f79b7424e2f0e1452d2bc6935932efa6f","ja":"うん！　お天気もいいし、\nこの調子なら、すぐかも！","zh":"嗯！天气也很好，\n照这样下去，说不定马上就到了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"705711550bace1f92974b88bff184c27e498b55013bbc5ae0aa7df0b7ffcacb7","ja":"それからしばらくして……","zh":"过了一段时间后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"182bef3d985f9292176150fa1845d463fe84597f8daa2c827c005ecb06cbc4b5","ja":"なんか、売れなくなってきたね……。","zh":"感觉有点卖不大动了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"051d56e230ac5d30c4e9a67b3e1f5e4bf2c6c5c9188f6535599632f82fad7228","ja":"天気予報が外れて、曇ってきちゃったからかな？\nちょっと涼しくなってきたし……。","zh":"是因为天气预报没说中，天阴下来了吗？\n而且也稍微变凉快了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"36ddf96d3371b0e6d81be0dcc616ba29b14c3583a18c937836d9e5cbe0b2f88d","ja":"このままだと、\n目標を達成するの、難しいかも……。","zh":"照这样下去，\n可能很难达成目标了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b5fe053a3fd6da5a35a58da628b34e67263747fabedde0373bdf139d46b315f4","ja":"そんなことないぞ！\nたまき、せんでんしてくる！","zh":"才没有那种事呢！\n环这就去帮忙宣传！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"644c865d99554d0997708d9072a1bee20c068c16b51868a12784dddfafad240a","ja":"かき氷、いかがですかー！\n冷たくって、すっごくおいしいぞー！","zh":"要来份刨冰吗——！\n冰冰凉凉的，超级美味哦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1643.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7090b302b7ca09e841b8906189733d48ae4f179531292302cad2a1e06a108a7c","ja":"環ちゃん……そうだよね！\nわたしももっと頑張らなきゃ！","zh":"环……你说得对！\n我也必须更加努力才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
